    {
      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Felix Rane:</b> Escalation is loud. Credentials are quiet. You break nothing, you simply sign in, and every log agrees that you belong there.\n\nWhat makes a place soft is never one careless employee. It is the rule underneath, applied to everybody at once, quietly setting the price of guessing for the entire organization.",
